OL,3,GNEWSAVAT cuts won't lower prices for
OL,4,Acustomers, say NI hospitality leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA VAT cut for hospitality businesses in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland would not mean lower
OL,8,Fprices for consumers, MPs have heard.
OL,10,FThe industry is asking the UK
OL,11,Fgovernment for a VAT cut to compete
OL,12,Fwith the lower rates charged in the
OL,13,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,15,FHospitality leaders say the cut is
OL,16,Fneeded to help with squeezed profit
OL,17,Fmargins and is a matter of survival,
OL,18,Fparticularly for businesses in border
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
