OL,3,GNEWSAVAT cuts won't lower prices for
OL,4,Acustomers, say NI hospitality leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has consistently
OL,7,Frejected a call for a hospitality VAT
OL,8,Fcut saying it would be poorly targeted
OL,9,Fand too expensive.
